## Why This Is Asked
Probes end-to-end Azure data pipelines with tenant isolation, idempotency, governance, and rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Durable Functions orchestration and replay safety
- Cosmos DB partitioning by tenantId
- CMK in Key Vault and envelope encryption
- Data governance with Purview; search with Cognitive Search
- Feature flags and canary testing for rule changes

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: idempotent processing sketch
async function processEvent(event, state) {
  const { eventId, tenantId, payload } = event;
  if (await state.hasProcessed(eventId)) return;
  await state.markProcessed(eventId);
  // transform and persist per-tenant
  await persistPerTenant(tenantId, payload);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test idempotency guarantees under failure scenarios?
- How would you design a rollback path when a data quality rule misbehaves?
